      "summary": "Dev_graph predicate node (PRED-002) defining the daily-loss-cap guard, which blocks new trades once realized daily P&L reaches the configured loss cap (daily_pnl > -daily_loss_cap).",
      "tags": ["documentation", "predicate", "guardrail", "risk-management", "dev-graph"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
